kicad (10.0.7+dfsg-1+trixie1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Downstream rebuild of the official Debian sid source package
    10.0.7+dfsg-1 for Debian 13 (trixie), amd64 only.
  * No source changes.  The vendored debian/ directory is the official
    Debian packaging; only this changelog entry is added.
  * The build is gated on Debian 13 dependency resolution, Lintian, a
    clean-container install test, and kicad-cli smoke tests.  See
    docs/BUILD.md and docs/RELEASE.md.
  * The kicad binary package does not include the separately packaged
    KiCad symbol/footprint/3D libraries.  Trixie ships 9.0.x library
    packages that conflict with KiCad 10; install matching KiCad 10
    libraries separately.

 -- KiCad Debian 13 Maintainers <kicad-debian13@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 21 Oct 2026 10:18:09 +0800

